izia Sky Original con Freida Pinto e Iwan Rheon. In cerca di un successo natalizio per la sua boy band, una manager trova un brano perfetto, scritto da un musicista metal..."},{"language":"en-US","overview":"Meg, a music manager, travels from New York to London to manage a boy band, Five Together, and find them a Christmas number one to bolster their flagging career.  She finds a song on the internet posted by an ailing thirteen-year-old girl, Nina, and tries to obtain permission to have the song re-recorded by Five Together, but she discovers she has competition from the songwriter, Nina’s uncle Blake. What follows is a romantic comedy about two worlds colliding – with a young woman at the centre who desperately wants her uncle to find love and for his song to hit the number one spot by Christmas Day."}],"images":{"logos":[],"posters":[],"backdrops":[]},"poster":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/1qkUG6UcUXwkrobQOtWfjcPQr76.jpg","background":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/h0QfGN4PjovosbfsvEn3Tujf56z.jpg","seasons":[],"schema":{}}},"artworkLibrary":{"tmdb":{"schemaVersion":1,"source":"tmdb","id":878111,"type":"movie","originalLanguage":"en-US","series":{"poster":{"it":{"status":"missing","candidates":[]},"en":{"status":"available","selected":{"type":"poster","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/1qkUG6UcUXwkrobQOtWfjcPQr76.jpg","previewUrl":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/1qkUG6UcUXwkrobQOtWfjcPQr76.jpg","language":"en","width":1000,"height":1500},"candidates":[{"type":"poster","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/1qkUG6UcUXwkrobQOtWfjcPQr76.jpg","previewUrl":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/1qkUG6UcUXwkrobQOtWfjcPQr76.jpg","language":"en","width":1000,"height":1500},{"type":"poster","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/wdPdBAKOOa8vJpAPIvyNWb5eQc7.jpg","previewUrl":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/wdPdBAKOOa8vJpAPIvyNWb5eQc7.jpg","language":"en","width":1080,"height":1600},{"type":"poster","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/pF9gPFaQ